{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment","id":907092,"title":"Garou, Kin, and Equipment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-04T07:30:12-07:00","id":907092,"title":"Garou, Kin, and Equipment","content":"Something Im hoping will be covered in the upcoming Kinfolk book <br /> <br /> Red Talons almost universally refuse to use Manufactured Tools, Bone Gnawers, and Glasswalkers are largely Urrah<br /> <br /> What about the other tribes.<br /> <br /> I find it hard to believe that they'd all be living like in a Amish village, using horse drawn carts and such<br /> <br /> Big thing I guess im asking is what kind of equipment a pack might have with them when on a journey, you need tents, survival knife, GPS... anything else? <br /> <br /> looked at a lot of books on kindle unlimited To see what its like...doing things like making Cheese, ferementing beer, just to get an overview, also","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T10:23:34-07:00","id":907163,"title":"","content":"The Garou will have whatever support their Sept and the local Kin are able and willing to give them. It's hard to be more specific than that (esp. with the WoD Resources system). As the RAW are, you've basically got to go with the members of the Pack's Resources ratings (since most stuff can be bought online these days it isn't that big of a deal to purchase equipment), Sept Standing (for what the Sept will hook them up with), and their dots in Backgrounds like Kinfolk.<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> Side note on the Amish: The Amish aren't actually as... averse as people think. The core to Amish philosophy is that technology is solely for work, and not for fun. A lot of Amish families have access to things like computers for business, and take steps to make sure that they're out-of-sight/out-of-mind to avoid them being used for other reasons. It's very different from the Garou anti-technology mindset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T10:36:20-07:00","id":907170,"title":"","content":"Fair enough<br /> <br /> Hmmmn, any advantages, a motorcycle has over lupus form, other then raw speed? <br /> <br /> ********<br /> <br /> Was thinking even they, and most Monastarys, would probaly rush someone who was terminal to a conventional hospital, but thank you for the info<br /> <br /> Which makes Alixus, from the Star trek DS9 episode &quot;Paradise&quot; All the more abhorrent., she deserves, fates so horrible I cant describe them without violating the TOS policy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T12:51:12-07:00","id":907242,"title":"","content":"I could see the following:<br /> <br /> Child of Gaia, having lots of survival stuff, including medical supplies and the like. <br /> Stargazers are the ones who imo would shun most material possessions like a lot of Buddists do..<br /> Get, would be like biker gangs<br /> Fianna would live like regular Irish folk","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T13:34:51-07:00","id":907266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment?p=907242#post907242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could see the following:<br /> <br /> Child of Gaia, having lots of survival stuff, including medical supplies and the like.<br /> Stargazers are the ones who imo would shun most material possessions like a lot of Buddists do..</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that they do it as often as you're suggesting. It's a big cross section, you won't get that much uniformity.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Get, would be like biker gangs </div> </div> </div>A bizarrely-placed stereotype, to be sure. If you're talking about Asatru-style stuff, the Get hate that. The All-Father's name is to be cursed alongside his lackey &quot;children&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Fianna would live like regular Irish folk </div> </div> </div>...That's straight out of first edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T14:00:42-07:00","id":907277,"title":"","content":"Im tenatively practicing with Shinto and buddhism, I dont eschew all material possesions. (nor do the priests, $100 anually for official membership of Tsubaki shrine washington) <br /> <br /> Im sure Their would be SOME radical Ascetics amongst the Stargazer kinfolk, a FEW more maybe then amongst other tribes, that doesnt mean that none of them are at all materialistic<br /> <br /> I could see many stargazers and their kin Owning impressive librarys of self help books or maybe have it all on a tablet or E reader, if on a Tablet have a bunch of meditation music too.<br /> <br /> Oh curious, how is tribute by human kinfolk given to the Garou? think its a percentage, of what they own, or buying weapons and such for them.<br /> <br /> It makes sense that kind of thing would stir up resentment, though the garou might try to help their kin avoid conventional taxes.if it can be done discreetly...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T15:01:56-07:00","id":907295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment?p=907170#post907170\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn, any advantages, a motorcycle has over lupus form, other then raw speed?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can go near humans and not get shot at?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T15:38:13-07:00","id":907310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment?p=907277#post907277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> (nor do the priests, $100 anually for official membership of Tsubaki shrine washington)</div> </div> </div> </div>Darn modern buildings with bills to pay.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T05:13:00-07:00","id":907570,"title":"","content":"hahaha I understand and your right maintaining things probaly is difficult... <br /> <br /> as for the thing on motorcycles, fair point, though in lupus any garou worth her salt, can hide in most cases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T14:00:00-07:00","id":907857,"title":"","content":"A bit more serious about the motorcycles:<br /> <br /> It really depends what kind.<br /> <br /> If you go for the whole biker club schtick, there's a lot of bonuses. Biker clubs are known for riding in large groups, prefer bikes aimed towards longer rides (which means saddlebags for lots of storage for supplies), are common sights at transitory sites like truck stops and camp grounds, and have a reputation for being rough folks which can help avoid the issues of Rage drawing undo attention.<br /> <br /> A guy in leathers on a racer doesn't have any of that going for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T07:03:35-07:00","id":908311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment?p=907163#post907163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Side note on the Amish: The Amish aren't actually as... averse as people think. The core to Amish philosophy is that technology is solely for work, and not for fun. A lot of Amish families have access to things like computers for business, and take steps to make sure that they're out-of-sight/out-of-mind to avoid them being used for other reasons. It's very different from the Garou anti-technology mindset.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this. A friend of mine grew up next to Amish country in Pennsylvania. One great example that is philosophically relevant for Garou: Amish own telephones, but they will often keep them in the barn. If you need to talk business or call a doctor, it's there. But you're never tempted to make a social call because it's not in your home.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T11:25:15-07:00","id":908455,"title":"","content":"While doing my security job at Jo-Ann fabrics i saw quite a few come in, and eventually got the gall up to ask one, as i thought they were Amish.. Turns out they were Mennonites, and are a lot different in outlook, but still appear the same as amish..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T13:14:10-07:00","id":908541,"title":"","content":"makes sense, just saying many kinfok and some garou will only hold the antitech thing so far...<br /> <br /> <br /> any ideas of good smartphone or Tablet apps, for a Garou or kinfolk?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T13:19:18-07:00","id":908544,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure we need to get into a whole Amish tangent here, but...<br /> <br /> 1) As a Pennsylvania resident myself, I can attest to the phone/fax/computer in the barn thing. Though that's not a universal Amish practice. It's more common around here because &quot;Amish&quot; is sort of an industry requiring more modernization for doing business with other people.<br /> <br /> 2) On the clothing thing, what you saw were Plain people. While Amish are the most well known Plain Christians, it is a broader category over a few denominations. Additionally some denominations are all Plain (like the Amish), while others have a mixture of Plain and not Plain sub-groups (the Mennonites are an example). While it can seem non-existent or extremely subtle, many of the Plain denominations have significant dress code differences that clearly identify which is which if you know what to look for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T13:20:42-07:00","id":908546,"title":"","content":"Useful Apps?<br /> <br /> Anything the Glasswalkers come up to extra security.<br /> <br /> Moonphase trackers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T20:58:58-07:00","id":908863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/907092-garou-kin-and-equipment?p=908546#post908546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Useful Apps?<br /> <br /> Anything the Glasswalkers come up to extra security.<br /> <br /> Moonphase trackers.</div> </div> </div> </div>How's about an Ap that Kin fetch trigger to let kin know that a changer has had his first change?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T21:22:07-07:00","id":908876,"title":"","content":"Well.... first, that's more of a Fetish or Talen (that would be a Glasswalker thing) than just an App.<br /> <br /> Second, it's kind of silly. The Garou don't need it since spirits can contact them without it, and kinfolk shouldn't be rushing to a First Change with an out of control cub in frenzy.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T06:49:47-07:00","id":909118,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn is a GPS a good thing to have on your tablet when your in the woods.<br /> <br /> oh 2 or 3 wilderness survival guides, for &quot;what to do in the event of a hurricane, what to do in the case of nuclear attack&quot; anything else you want in the wilds...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imag